  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: Resurrectionist. Body snatcher. No matter what you're called, you
    know where the bodies are buried, and how many coins they'll fetch when dug up.
    Adventuring comes naturally to you-in your mind dungeons are just oversized tombs-as
    does returning home with your loot undetected. Choose two attribute boosts. One
    must be to Strength or Dexterity , and one is a free attribute boost. You're
    trained in the Stealth skill and the Underworld Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Experienced
    Smuggler] skill feat.
